work-obj*.cf

# The old SpinalHDL output directory, REMOVED 2026-09-04. Generated RTL now
# lands under build/<config>/rtl (a preset) or build/standalone/<generator>
# (a component or testbench belonging to no preset), both covered by the
# /build/ rule above. Nothing writes into the source tree any more, and
# check-no-legacy-rtl-path.sh fails the build if anything starts again.

# Backstop. Before the unification there were four conventions -- bare
# "generated", "generated/verilog", "generated/vhdl", and a dead
# "core/spinalhdl/generated" -- and generated/JopCore.v was tracked, so every
# run of JopCoreVerilog (CI included) dirtied the tree with a spurious diff.
# Nothing writes here now; the rule stays so a reintroduced default cannot
# quietly get committed again.
/generated/
/core/
spinalhdl/*.vhd
spinalhdl/*.v
spinalhdl/simWorkspace/
spinalhdl/tmp/
spinalhdl/spinal/
simWorkspace/

# Quartus build artifacts (project source files .qpf/.qsf/.sdc tracked per project)
**/db/
**/incremental_db/
**/output_files/
*.rpt
*.summary
*.sld
*.jdi
*.pin
*.sof
*.pof
*.cdf
*.done
*.smsg
*.bin
c5_pin_model_dump.txt
*.stp
*.sof.old
*_assignment_defaults.qdf

